WEBVTT

00:02:31.850 --> 00:02:34.520
It's 4:20.
Should be plenty of time.

00:02:47.870 --> 00:02:48.920
Mitaka!

00:02:49.540 --> 00:02:52.020
What're the Fancy clothes For?
The lizard!

00:03:06.890 --> 00:03:10.400
T-The manager is going
on a date with Mitaka?

00:03:25.580 --> 00:03:26.870
And these were
so expensive, too.

00:03:29.250 --> 00:03:29.920
Damn!

00:03:33.580 --> 00:03:34.560
Better not waste 'em.

00:03:42.930 --> 00:03:45.040
Yo, Sakamoto?
It's me, Godai.

00:03:45.590 --> 00:03:47.520
You got time
to see a movie?

00:03:49.930 --> 00:03:51.710
l got the tickets.
Reserved seats.

00:03:52.590 --> 00:03:54.680
Your treat, huh? That's
unusual Iy generous of you.

00:03:55.270 --> 00:03:55.910
You idiot!

00:03:55.940 --> 00:03:58.190
Not a chance!
Pay for your own ticket!

00:03:59.270 --> 00:04:00.770
What? You're broke?

00:04:01.270 --> 00:04:02.440
Damn!

00:04:02.940 --> 00:04:03.550
What?

00:04:03.940 --> 00:04:06.790
No, stupid, if I had a girl to take,
you think I'd call you?

00:04:07.620 --> 00:04:09.870
What's that laugh?
Making fun of me?

00:04:10.620 --> 00:04:12.460
You have no
right to laugh!

00:04:13.620 --> 00:04:16.280
I'm nice enough
to ask you to...

00:04:17.960 --> 00:04:19.300
I'm hanging up.
Somebody's waiting.

00:04:20.630 --> 00:04:21.710
You're Godai, right?

00:04:27.970 --> 00:04:29.480
Don't you
recognize me?

00:04:37.650 --> 00:04:38.380
Look!

00:04:39.310 --> 00:04:40.750
We worked at
the same liquor store!

00:04:40.980 --> 00:04:41.500
That's right!

00:04:42.980 --> 00:04:43.800
I...

00:04:45.660 --> 00:04:46.940
I'm Kozue Nanao.

00:04:48.310 --> 00:04:49.870
T-That's right! Kozue!

00:04:50.330 --> 00:04:52.230
Guess I didn't make
much of an impression.

00:04:53.660 --> 00:04:58.480
I was always out on deliveries.
Besides, I'm rotten with names.

00:04:59.340 --> 00:05:02.350
And you look so different
without your glasses.

00:05:04.340 --> 00:05:06.420
I saved my paychecks
and got contact lenses.

00:05:08.340 --> 00:05:09.160
Contacts...

00:05:09.340 --> 00:05:13.130
I planned on getting something else,
but I changed my mind.

00:05:14.680 --> 00:05:15.230
How come?

00:05:16.340 --> 00:05:18.840
Can't you guess?

00:05:19.690 --> 00:05:21.050
I guess you wouldn't.

00:05:23.690 --> 00:05:24.940
What the heck i's
she talking about?

00:05:33.690 --> 00:05:35.250
What are those?

00:05:36.040 --> 00:05:37.730
These? Movie tickets.

00:05:38.040 --> 00:05:39.410
Wow, these are
reserved seats, too.

00:05:40.040 --> 00:05:44.930
You know, that movie is pretty
popular with the girls right now.

00:05:47.380 --> 00:05:49.550
That's kinda why I bought
them in the first place.

00:05:59.050 --> 00:06:02.340
Boy, you're lucky.
I really wish I could see it.

00:06:03.060 --> 00:06:04.380
That'd sure be nice.

00:06:08.400 --> 00:06:10.540
Well... Would you join me?

00:06:11.730 --> 00:06:12.550
Really?

00:06:16.410 --> 00:06:17.430
Sorry.

00:06:18.080 --> 00:06:19.850
I kinda feel like
I forced you to invite me.

00:06:20.420 --> 00:06:22.760
Not at all. I didn't
want to go alone.

00:06:29.760 --> 00:06:31.510
I hope I didn't
ruin your plans.

00:06:31.760 --> 00:06:32.900
O-Of course not.

00:06:34.090 --> 00:06:36.500
I wonder where Mitaka
took the manager?

00:06:37.770 --> 00:06:39.580
Damn! What can
they be doing now?

00:06:41.770 --> 00:06:42.670
Is something wrong?

00:06:43.440 --> 00:06:44.870
Oh no!

00:06:45.780 --> 00:06:47.270
I'm sorry about this, Kyoko.

00:06:47.440 --> 00:06:48.260
That's okay.

00:06:50.780 --> 00:06:51.560
Oh geez!

00:06:51.780 --> 00:06:53.590
What's the matter?
We have to hurry!

00:06:54.440 --> 00:06:56.260
L-Let's take
another route.

00:06:56.790 --> 00:06:59.040
But why? The train station
is right there.

00:06:59.460 --> 00:07:00.280
It's okay.

00:07:00.460 --> 00:07:02.040
Hey, Godai!

00:07:02.790 --> 00:07:04.560
Is that you, Godai?

00:07:05.460 --> 00:07:06.830
H-Hello!

00:07:09.470 --> 00:07:11.550
W-What a coincidence!

00:07:12.140 --> 00:07:13.890
You're on a date, too?

00:07:14.470 --> 00:07:17.540
You're a quick mover, with
your arms around her already.

00:07:23.480 --> 00:07:25.840
T-This is a co-worker
from a previous job.

00:07:26.150 --> 00:07:26.880
Hello!

00:07:30.810 --> 00:07:31.690
Hello.

00:07:33.480 --> 00:07:34.830
S-She is...

00:07:35.160 --> 00:07:37.530
Let's go. We'll be late
for the movie!

00:07:38.830 --> 00:07:39.810
I-I...

00:07:40.160 --> 00:07:41.120
Excuse us.

00:07:42.170 --> 00:07:44.690
You make such
a cute couple.

00:07:46.500 --> 00:07:47.480
Hurry up!

00:08:03.940 --> 00:08:05.260
I thought
he said he loved me.

00:08:06.350 --> 00:08:09.050
But he has a
cute, young girlfriend.

00:08:09.960 --> 00:08:11.190
He made a Fool of me!

00:08:11.460 --> 00:08:13.920
How awful! Playing
with a woman's feelings!

00:08:15.530 --> 00:08:17.960
We'd better hurry or
we'll be late for the concert!

00:08:18.530 --> 00:08:19.900
it won't be long.

00:08:21.870 --> 00:08:23.180
I've had it!

00:08:24.870 --> 00:08:26.390
I-I'm sorry!

00:08:26.880 --> 00:08:28.100
N-No.

00:08:28.540 --> 00:08:30.880
I'm sorry.
It wasn't you.

00:08:32.550 --> 00:08:34.980
T-That was scary!

00:08:44.890 --> 00:08:46.970
I had no idea this
was a horror movie.

00:08:47.550 --> 00:08:50.110
I'm kinda glad I didn't
ask the manager to come.

00:09:14.260 --> 00:09:15.130
Eeek!

00:09:19.590 --> 00:09:20.390
Eeek!

00:09:21.930 --> 00:09:24.090
Then again, if onIy
she WERE the manager!

00:09:38.280 --> 00:09:39.560
An Evening of Mozart

00:09:40.620 --> 00:09:42.290
What a wonderful concert.

00:09:43.290 --> 00:09:44.630
I'm glad that you came.

00:09:45.290 --> 00:09:46.580
Let's do this again.

00:09:46.960 --> 00:09:48.940
Sure, if you like.

00:09:49.630 --> 00:09:53.110
Of course. It's like a
dream to be with you.

00:09:54.300 --> 00:09:57.230
And may I add,
you're looking very beautiful tonight.

00:09:57.970 --> 00:10:00.080
Just tonight?

00:10:01.300 --> 00:10:03.470
That's not
what I meant.

00:10:03.640 --> 00:10:04.870
You stinker.

00:10:10.300 --> 00:10:14.000
I didn't know he had such
a cute, young girlfriend.

00:10:17.310 --> 00:10:20.720
Kyoko. Let me
treat you to dinner!

00:10:21.660 --> 00:10:24.500
Then he made excuses.
Can't he be a man?

00:10:24.990 --> 00:10:26.980
A drink or two
might be nice.

00:10:27.660 --> 00:10:29.470
I'm driving,
so I guess I can't.

00:10:29.670 --> 00:10:30.900
Don't make me laugh!

00:10:35.340 --> 00:10:38.150
I understand!
Drinks are out.

00:10:38.670 --> 00:10:40.250
l-l didn't mean that!

00:10:42.010 --> 00:10:44.180
I'm not myself today.

00:11:02.690 --> 00:11:04.090
That was scary!

00:11:04.690 --> 00:11:07.480
That was grotesque!
No dinner for me.

00:11:08.370 --> 00:11:09.660
I'm starved.

00:11:21.380 --> 00:11:22.400
She's hanging all over him.

00:11:23.390 --> 00:11:24.690
l wonder if they're
like that all the time?

00:11:25.390 --> 00:11:26.150
Kyoko.

00:11:26.390 --> 00:11:29.490
I know a nice restaurant with
a view of nighttime Yokohama.

00:11:30.050 --> 00:11:32.430
It's a long drive, but
if you wouldn't mind...

00:11:34.400 --> 00:11:35.420
Uhh, Kyoko?

00:11:36.730 --> 00:11:40.940
O-Of course, Yokohama
might be a little too far.

00:11:41.400 --> 00:11:42.160
Nonsense!

00:11:43.410 --> 00:11:45.780
I'll go to Yokohama
or anywhere else with you!

00:11:46.080 --> 00:11:48.160
I-Is that a yes?

00:12:21.780 --> 00:12:23.770
May I ask you
one thing?

00:12:24.960 --> 00:12:25.810
What is it?

00:12:26.300 --> 00:12:30.980
Was the concert the only reason
you came with me?

00:12:42.310 --> 00:12:43.270
I don't think that's it.

00:12:44.650 --> 00:12:46.900
So you have
another reason?

00:12:47.650 --> 00:12:48.200
That's right.

00:12:49.650 --> 00:12:51.930
I do enjoy being with you.

00:12:57.980 --> 00:12:59.860
Kyoko, does that mean...

00:13:00.660 --> 00:13:01.770
We're such good friends.

00:13:03.670 --> 00:13:07.300
You're my only friend who allows me
to forget I'm a manager.

00:13:08.990 --> 00:13:10.020
To forget...

00:13:11.010 --> 00:13:12.060
And as a man?

00:13:15.340 --> 00:13:17.390
You're also seeing someone,
aren't you?

00:13:18.010 --> 00:13:18.770
''Also''?

00:13:19.010 --> 00:13:20.490
Ms. Otonashi, are you...?

00:13:21.020 --> 00:13:22.630
N-No. Not l.

00:13:38.700 --> 00:13:40.840
No one. I'm not
seeing anyone at all.

00:13:47.040 --> 00:13:48.380
I-I see.

00:13:59.720 --> 00:14:01.230
Can I ask you something?

00:14:01.720 --> 00:14:02.330
What?

00:14:05.060 --> 00:14:07.480
Who were you planning to
take to the movie tonight?

00:14:09.730 --> 00:14:10.430
Nobody!

00:14:10.730 --> 00:14:12.280
That lady we saw?

00:14:12.730 --> 00:14:13.990
Naw, not her!

00:14:16.410 --> 00:14:17.280
No...

00:14:17.410 --> 00:14:21.100
I mean, she and her boyfriend
looked so perfect together.

00:14:22.410 --> 00:14:23.520
That's mine!

00:14:25.740 --> 00:14:30.230
it doesn't matter. Whoever you intended,
I had a great time.

00:14:31.740 --> 00:14:32.710
What about you, Godai?

00:14:34.420 --> 00:14:35.730
You weren't bored
with me, were you?

00:14:36.090 --> 00:14:37.320
N-Nothing like that!

00:14:37.430 --> 00:14:38.450
You're real cute and...

00:14:39.430 --> 00:14:41.180
Think so?
I'm so happy!

00:14:41.430 --> 00:14:43.210
I knew I was right
to go with the contacts.

00:14:53.110 --> 00:14:55.190
This park is
a short-cut, but...

00:14:55.780 --> 00:14:58.180
...I usually walk through
the shopping district.

00:15:16.130 --> 00:15:19.230
But you're with me,
so I'm not afraid.

00:15:21.470 --> 00:15:23.080
I might be scarier
than you think.

00:15:26.140 --> 00:15:27.840
Just kidding!
Just kidding!

00:15:28.480 --> 00:15:29.180
No.

00:15:30.810 --> 00:15:32.560
Am I...a woman?

00:15:33.480 --> 00:15:35.700
W-What is she
talking about?

00:15:37.480 --> 00:15:40.180
Godai, do you
see me as a woman?

00:15:40.480 --> 00:15:42.390
Not just as some co-worker?

00:15:44.160 --> 00:15:45.180
That's great!

00:16:07.850 --> 00:16:10.510
This isn't right. I'm being
swept up in the mood.

00:16:12.190 --> 00:16:13.680
but just one kiss...

00:16:16.190 --> 00:16:17.490
This is so good!

00:16:20.530 --> 00:16:21.790
I was so thirsty!

00:16:22.530 --> 00:16:23.820
Me too!

00:16:51.230 --> 00:16:52.430
K-Kozue...

00:16:53.230 --> 00:16:54.400
Can I see you again?

00:16:55.230 --> 00:16:57.420
She must like me.

00:17:01.570 --> 00:17:03.150
D-Don't scare me!

00:17:05.570 --> 00:17:07.410
What's that look for?

00:17:08.240 --> 00:17:12.140
Just to clear the air:
I didn't do anything wrong.

00:17:14.580 --> 00:17:18.860
l might have wanted to,
but I wasn't able to act on it.

00:17:20.910 --> 00:17:22.760
What's wrong, Soichiro?

00:17:23.590 --> 00:17:25.340
You sound sad.

00:17:29.260 --> 00:17:31.280
I thought it
was the manager.

00:17:32.940 --> 00:17:35.490
She's not back yet?

00:17:35.940 --> 00:17:38.520
Not yet. And it's
past 11:30 already.

00:18:41.000 --> 00:18:41.610
That does it!

00:18:54.020 --> 00:18:54.660
Time for bed!

00:19:00.020 --> 00:19:00.890
Allow me.

00:19:03.690 --> 00:19:04.650
Mr. Yotsuya!

00:19:05.030 --> 00:19:08.900
Young Godai, you mustn't turn
a blind eye to the truth!

00:19:09.700 --> 00:19:10.870
You want something?

00:19:14.370 --> 00:19:15.570
I feel your agony.

00:19:18.700 --> 00:19:20.660
Drinking's best
at times like these.

00:19:21.380 --> 00:19:24.450
What's with you?
Don't come barging into my room!

00:19:25.380 --> 00:19:27.660
We're here to share
your apprehensions.

00:19:28.720 --> 00:19:30.240
I'm not worried.

00:19:31.050 --> 00:19:34.450
The Mitaka gentleman
Is a captivating rogue.

00:19:35.060 --> 00:19:37.310
His eyes are
so seductive!

00:19:38.060 --> 00:19:40.750
Y-You're wrong.
The manager would never...

00:19:41.060 --> 00:19:44.520
On the contrary.
She is inexperienced with that.

00:19:45.070 --> 00:19:47.240
For a widow
she's pretty naive.

00:19:47.740 --> 00:19:49.930
The type to be
swept off her feet.

00:19:55.410 --> 00:19:59.070
The nighttime mist conceals
our clandestine love.

00:20:00.750 --> 00:20:03.940
I'd like to thank it, if
only for bringing us together.

00:20:10.430 --> 00:20:11.220
Mitaka.

00:20:11.760 --> 00:20:12.450
Kyoko.

00:20:20.100 --> 00:20:23.230
Drink, be merry,
and forget the world.

00:20:24.110 --> 00:20:26.480
Good heavens!
Look at the time!

00:20:27.110 --> 00:20:28.040
So drink up!

00:20:28.110 --> 00:20:32.240
- - She's shackin' up tonight.
- - One or two nights in a strange bed...

00:20:33.120 --> 00:20:34.410
They ain't teenagers.

00:20:34.780 --> 00:20:37.150
Drink up. She won't
be back anyway!

00:20:41.790 --> 00:20:44.450
It's gotten so late.

00:20:46.130 --> 00:20:47.200
But it was fun!

00:20:47.450 --> 00:20:49.130
May I ask you out again?

00:20:49.450 --> 00:20:50.100
Of course.

00:20:51.130 --> 00:20:53.000
Not just ''to forget''
next time.

00:20:59.140 --> 00:21:01.890
''Shall we all drop
to the lowest depths of hell? ''

00:21:02.480 --> 00:21:05.950
''Searching for happiness in
the lowest depths of hell! ''

00:21:06.480 --> 00:21:08.590
''Rejected, rejected;
She hates me now; ''

00:21:08.820 --> 00:21:11.840
''l die and drink, and Fall
to the lowest depths of hell. ''

00:21:13.160 --> 00:21:14.590
S-She's back!

00:21:24.500 --> 00:21:25.870
- - Here you go.
- - Thank you.

00:21:39.180 --> 00:21:40.790
Maybe I will have one.

00:21:43.520 --> 00:21:44.250
This is boring.

00:21:44.520 --> 00:21:45.690
I'll take my leave.

00:21:46.190 --> 00:21:47.530
- - Off to bed.
- - Don't!

00:21:52.530 --> 00:21:53.160
Stop it!

00:21:53.530 --> 00:21:54.790
Restrain yourself, Godai!

00:21:54.860 --> 00:21:56.320
Let me go!
Let me go!

00:21:56.860 --> 00:21:59.330
You mustn't!
Be calm, Godai!

00:22:02.540 --> 00:22:03.880
Let go!
Let go!

00:22:04.200 --> 00:22:05.000
Impossible.

00:22:05.200 --> 00:22:07.840
- - This is no time to butt in.
- - M-Manager!

00:22:13.220 --> 00:22:14.070
Mr. Mitaka!

00:22:14.880 --> 00:22:17.050
Don't!
Please stop that!

00:22:17.550 --> 00:22:19.100
M-Manager!

00:22:19.550 --> 00:22:23.090
How forceful, the power of love.
Victory is yours!

00:22:28.560 --> 00:22:30.520
S-Stop it, please!

00:22:30.900 --> 00:22:32.040
Please stop it!

00:22:33.900 --> 00:22:35.440
M-Manager...

00:22:36.900 --> 00:22:38.610
Stop it, Soichiro!

00:22:39.240 --> 00:22:41.860
I'm sorry, Mitaka,
he's ruined your suit.

00:22:48.250 --> 00:22:49.480
What a letdown.

00:22:49.910 --> 00:22:52.440
Is it disappointing?
Is it amusing?

00:22:52.590 --> 00:22:56.250
Manager, don't confuse us
in the middle of the night.

00:22:56.930 --> 00:22:58.940
What were you
expecting to see?

00:23:03.270 --> 00:23:04.790
Anyway, let's
start the drinking.

00:23:05.270 --> 00:23:07.050
We must rejoin
the indulgence.

00:23:07.600 --> 00:23:08.270
Godai?

00:23:10.610 --> 00:23:13.190
Please, Soichiro! Stop it!

00:23:50.310 --> 00:23:54.180
I'm so angry! He's getting calls
from so many different girls.

00:23:54.980 --> 00:23:56.880
Every day. One call
after another!

00:23:57.320 --> 00:24:00.650
Next: ''Godai the Gigolo...?
Are You Going to Get That, or Shall l?''

00:24:01.320 --> 00:24:04.780
All Godai's flirting...
What a skirt-chaser!
